cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Code for: A Quasi-Experimental Evaluation of Rail Station Effects on Property Values in Devon"
abstract: >-
  Python notebooks that reproduce the MSc dissertation "A Quasi-Experimental
  Evaluation of Rail Station Effects on Property Values in Devon" (University
  of Exeter, 2026). A triple-difference hedonic design with wild cluster
  bootstrap inference evaluates the Okehampton (2021) and Marsh Barton (2023)
  station openings against ten control stations. The data are on Zenodo.
